<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	 GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	16,000.0    4.15 DEM	5.20 PCT	5.97 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	18,000.0    2.44 DEM	9.36 PCT     10.15 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	19,000.0    1.78 DEM     12.22 PCT     13.91 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL D	21,000.0    0.88 DEM     19.64 PCT     28.14 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT E	 16,000.0    1.32 DEM     16.88 PCT     18.76 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	 18,000.0    2.33 DEM	9.91 PCT     10.59 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.JAN.97-16.APR.98   PAYDATE	21.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  18,090.0</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
